# Step 4 – Requirement Traceability Matrix (RTM)

Create an RTM that maps every functional requirement (FR1–FR9) from the PRD to one or more test cases, ensuring no requirement is left uncovered. 

---

# Step 5 – Clarifications

If any requirement is unclear or missing, create a section titled **"Clarifications Required"** instead of making assumptions.

